      "en": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "יציאת מצרים—We must remember that Hashem took us out of Egypt with great miracles, which gives us hope that He will again redeem us and take us out of this final galus!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "מעמד הר סיני—We must remember the unique defining moment of Bnei Yisrael, when Hashem spoke to three million of us at Har Sinai, and gave us His Torah."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "מעשה עמלק—We must remember the evil of Amalek attacking us for no reason right after the miracle of the splitting of the sea. We are obligated to wipe out evil!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "מעשה העגל—We must remember how we angered Hashem when we attempted to serve Him our own way, rather than as prescribed by His Torah, notwithstanding all our good intentions!"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
